Apple last week unveiled five new apps, with four announced at <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/wwdc/">WWDC 2026</a> alongside its upcoming fall software updates, one released in beta for developers, and one released independently by its subsidiary Claris.<br/>
<br/>
